  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 6601.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6601.01 Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to set forth the requirements that all high-level radioactive waste carriers and shippers must comply with before transporting high-level radioactive waste through the state.\n\nSource. #7287, eff 5-24-00; ss by #9154, eff 5-8-08",
